    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Continent Falls, the Demon Horde Invades, the World on the Brink of Destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final hope of all races rests on the great city of Belrak. As the most valiant warrior within its walls, it is your time to unite the races, defend the gates, and hold the last three lines of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBeyond Traditional Tower Defense\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Command your hero to synergize with defensive towers\u2014cover each other, repel enemies, or even \u200b<strong>\u200blaunch yourself into battle\u200b</strong>\u200b using a tower\u2019s power! Absorb tower energy to empower your hero and unleash chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.poster.avif?t=1746249825\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.webm?t=1746249825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.mp4?t=1746249825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRoguelike-Style Progression\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Build your strategy dynamically with endless upgrades. Strengthen your hero to dominate the battlefield or deploy followers (towers) with precision to rain fire on the hordes. Every run is a fresh challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Heroic Playstyles\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Choose from heroes with wildly distinct combat styles: berserk attackers, relentless assassins, spellcasting mages, tower-defending guardians, and more. Experiment with unique builds and synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFollowers &amp; Ultimate Transformations\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Command \u200b<strong>\u200bdozens of followers\u200b</strong>\u200b (defensive towers), each with multiple upgrade paths. Use mystic relics to \u200b<strong>\u200bevolve them into ultimate forms\u200b</strong>\u200b, adapting your arsenal to crush ever-growing threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bUnbreakable Gates\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>The city\u2019s towering gates grant time to regroup\u2014hero or follower deaths won\u2019t end the battle. But remember: \u200b<strong>\u200bif the gates fall, all is lost!\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBosses &amp; Relics of Power\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Face apocalyptic demonic bosses every 5 minutes. Defeat them to claim their \u200b<strong>\u200bgame-changing relics\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014but tread carefully, for risk and reward go hand in hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bPersistent Growth\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Even defeat fuels your rise! Earn experience to unlock new content, fortify defenses, and grow stronger between battles. Every fight brings you closer to victory!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Continent Falls, the Demon Horde Invades, the World on the Brink of Destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final hope of all races rests on the great city of Belrak. As the most valiant warrior within its walls, it is your time to unite the races, defend the gates, and hold the last three lines of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBeyond Traditional Tower Defense\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Command your hero to synergize with defensive towers\u2014cover each other, repel enemies, or even \u200b<strong>\u200blaunch yourself into battle\u200b</strong>\u200b using a tower\u2019s power! Absorb tower energy to empower your hero and unleash chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.poster.avif?t=1746249825\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.webm?t=1746249825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688990/extras/17ab2f25aba9d666aef7430b16acd88f.mp4?t=1746249825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRoguelike-Style Progression\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Build your strategy dynamically with endless upgrades. Strengthen your hero to dominate the battlefield or deploy followers (towers) with precision to rain fire on the hordes. Every run is a fresh challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Heroic Playstyles\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Choose from heroes with wildly distinct combat styles: berserk attackers, relentless assassins, spellcasting mages, tower-defending guardians, and more. Experiment with unique builds and synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFollowers &amp; Ultimate Transformations\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Command \u200b<strong>\u200bdozens of followers\u200b</strong>\u200b (defensive towers), each with multiple upgrade paths. Use mystic relics to \u200b<strong>\u200bevolve them into ultimate forms\u200b</strong>\u200b, adapting your arsenal to crush ever-growing threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bUnbreakable Gates\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>The city\u2019s towering gates grant time to regroup\u2014hero or follower deaths won\u2019t end the battle. But remember: \u200b<strong>\u200bif the gates fall, all is lost!\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBosses &amp; Relics of Power\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Face apocalyptic demonic bosses every 5 minutes. Defeat them to claim their \u200b<strong>\u200bgame-changing relics\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014but tread carefully, for risk and reward go hand in hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bPersistent Growth\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>Even defeat fuels your rise! Earn experience to unlock new content, fortify defenses, and grow stronger between battles. Every fight brings you closer to victory!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Gate Warfare&quot; is a medieval fantasy roguelike tower defense game where players take on the role of a kingdom's hero. Fend off endless waves of demonic hordes, recruit companions, upgrade your skills, and defend the last bastion of hope\u2014the great city of Belrak.",
